      <article><div>{{ status("direction", "Committed direction") }}</div><h3>Accepted constraint, not shipped</h3><p>Separate daemon and broker processes, broker-owned credentials, a shared engine/cache, fresh stores, and narrow asynchronous host functions are design commitments.</p></article>
